BT /F2 16.0 Tf 56 764.4 Td (MySQL) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 703.4 Td (MySQL is a free and open-source relational database management system \(RDBMS\). Its name is a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 689.9 Td (combination of "My", the name of co-founder Michael Widenius' daughter My, and "SQL", the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 676.4 Td (acronym for Structured Query Language. A relational database organizes data into one or more) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 662.9 Td (data tables in which data may be related to each other; these relations help structure the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 649.4 Td (data. SQL is a language that programmers use to create, modify and extract data from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 635.9 Td (relational database, as well as control user access to the database. In addition to relational) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 622.4 Td (databases and SQL, an RDBMS like MySQL works with an operating system to implement a relational) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 608.9 Td (database in a computer's storage system, manages users, allows for network access and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 595.4 Td (facilitates testing database integrity and creation of backups.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 552.2 Td (MySQL is free and open-source software under the terms of the GNU General Public License, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 538.7 Td (is also available under a variety of proprietary licenses. MySQL was owned and sponsored by the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 525.2 Td (Swedish company MySQL AB, which was bought by Sun Microsystems \(now Oracle Corporation\). In) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 511.7 Td (2010, when Oracle acquired Sun, Widenius forked the open-source MySQL project to create) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 498.2 Td (MariaDB.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 455.0 Td (MySQL has stand-alone clients that allow users to interact directly with a MySQL database using) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 441.5 Td (SQL, but more often, MySQL is used with other programs to implement applications that need) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 428.0 Td (relational database capability. MySQL is a component of the LAMP web application software stack) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 414.5 Td (\(and others\), which is an acronym for Linux, Apache, MySQL, Perl/PHP/Python. MySQL is used by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 401.0 Td (many database-driven web applications, including Drupal, Joomla, phpBB, and WordPress. MySQL is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 387.5 Td (also used by many popular websites, including Facebook, Flickr, MediaWiki, Twitter, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 374.0 Td (YouTube.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.5 Tf 56 327.4 Td (Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 276.8 Td (MySQL is written in C and C++. Its SQL parser is written in yacc, but it uses a home-brewed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 263.3 Td (lexical analyzer. MySQL works on many system platforms, including IBM AIX, BSDi, FreeBSD,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 249.8 Td (HP-UX, ArcaOS, eComStation, IBM i, IRIX, Linux, macOS, Microsoft Windows, NetBSD, Novell) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 236.3 Td (NetWare, OpenBSD, OpenSolaris, OS/2 Warp, QNX, Oracle Solaris, Symbian, SunOS, SCO OpenServer,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 222.8 Td (SCO UnixWare, Sanos and Tru64. A port of MySQL to OpenVMS also exists.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 179.6 Td (The MySQL server software itself and the client libraries use dual-licensing distribution. They) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 166.1 Td (are offered under GPL version 2, or a proprietary license.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 122.9 Td (Support can be obtained from the official manual. Free support additionally is available in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 109.4 Td (different IRC channels and forums. Oracle offers paid support via its MySQL Enterprise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 95.9 Td (products. They differ in the scope of services and in price. Additionally, a number of third) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 82.4 Td (party organisations exist to provide support and services.) Tj ET
